{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af8d5a4c573d6d93538f065c4cff3be07fa46046fed617cea84690e8790fe281", "ja": "（瑞希がミリタリー映画の宣伝も兼ねて、サバイバル\nゲームのイベントにゲスト参戦した。結果は……）", "zh": "（瑞希还参加了生存游戏活动的嘉宾环节，同时也为军事电影做宣传。结果是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "7043809552e049fc08c867905e79353f4cdeb6b455c3625895ee2f4c520fce26", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n見事優勝です。……ぶい。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n漂亮地夺冠了。……V。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ddd05c068a4336858e4894c0f6e42733247d791873733bda7a1163e0663045b2", "ja": "すごいじゃないか、瑞希！\nハンデもあったけど、まさか優勝するとは……。", "zh": "真厉害啊，瑞希！\n虽然有让步，但没想到你居然能夺冠……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "d54bc143ad90c8fadb21f35ac94bdb7f01804d94d28ce5c47642fef90aaf5a09", "ja": "自分でも驚きです。対戦相手のみなさんは、\nサバイバルゲームに慣れている方ばかりでしたから。", "zh": "连我自己都感到惊讶。因为对手们全都是熟悉生存游戏的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "015168c84c1b98930d6910edeaf5f7f6328c8489399327dfc4a046adcbe1aa6a", "ja": "私は、チームの足を引っ張らないように集中していた\nだけで。運が味方してくれたようですね。", "zh": "我只是专心想着不要拖团队的后腿。看来是运气站在我这边呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f946ed0f510466ab43befadaadef15227f84c74a970f21401993c3e986e764e1", "ja": "確かに、運の良さもあるだろうけど。\n瑞希が真剣に頑張ったからこその結果だと思うよ。", "zh": "确实，运气好也是一方面。\n但我觉得，这个结果是因为瑞希认真努力才得来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "90bd20602ba07960a03dca83f6a6c5352d805b44ee419b54c3553f500e3f7adf", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがとうございます。\nそう言ってもらえると嬉しいです。……てれてれ。", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢您。\n您能这么说，我很开心。……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "e836c8853c73a4fffc46a6b0ac86a8d39c77e7c9213ba12af2262bde2c3d12b2", "ja": "すごく楽しかったので、また参加してみたいです。\n今度は、{$P$}も一緒に。", "zh": "因为特别开心，所以还想再参加一次。  \n下次也想和{$P$}一起参加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b7be9641947f05208f30c576bc59325d7444a7f09b5fd4476c6dd6c16ce5ac71", "ja": "お、いいな。瑞希の試合を見てたら、\n俺も参戦したい気持ちが高まってきてね。", "zh": "哦，真不错。看着瑞希的比赛，\n我也越来越想上场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "10e1dd3c2bbabe761dcb620d65f5b1cc74bbaabf5bf1254aa9fb17ba0ebc919e", "ja": "そうですか。気心の知れた相棒に背中を預けて戦う\nスリルと高揚感……熱い戦いになりそうです。", "zh": "是吗。把后背交给默契十足的搭档并肩作战，那种刺激与兴奋感……看来会是一场热血沸腾的战斗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "d8622f85764e1f464abda6b4932af32a2280216b54481713b1e746837d530c54", "ja": "せっかくですから、最上さんや春日さんも誘って、\n映画のチームを再現しましょう。", "zh": "难得有这个机会，把最上小姐和春日小姐也叫上，重现电影里的队伍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "0d2d3e7d597a6a5c5335a3ed04ec4d5f9d9c0062474c524dab29573284cfc7e1", "ja": "第765部隊、再結成だぞ。……パチパチパチ。", "zh": "第765部队，重新集结。……啪啪啪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1012_p", "source_sha256": "86683892855b48a191f99a268beea7a37dfbaf043542ba4ea751f501901198ee", "ja": "おお～。それは楽しくなりそうだ。", "zh": "哦哦～！听起来会很有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "65ef5d1d6b2068c6a820f83a3e524d7b77cafbdd16ff74c3f3bb7214c7e968c6", "ja": "共に死線を乗り越え、ミルクで乾杯した私たちなら、\nチームワークも完璧です。……映画の中の話ですが。", "zh": "我们共同跨越过生死关头，还用牛奶干杯过，团队合作当然也完美无缺。……不过，这些都是电影里的情节。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1014_p", "source_sha256": "98bbf6d972ba0c7f5754822e5e50ba9b5d7ceecec784b27f864cdc14b5e03a75", "ja": "ははっ。アイドルとしても、みんなのチームワークは\nバッチリだ。むしろ、俺が足を引っ張りそうだ……。", "zh": "哈哈。大家作为偶像，团队合作也非常默契。倒不如说，可能会是我拖大家后腿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0563_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "3cfb030ab9f101e1eafb01ece495a6766b41228df6a78663eb7e5f13308b1d69", "ja": "ご安心を。私が{$P$}をサポート\nしながら、チームを優勝に導きます。……めらめら。", "zh": "请放心。我会一边支持{$P$}，一边带领团队赢得冠军。……熊熊燃烧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
